1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,240
I'm Christina Koch,
I'm a mission specialist

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,433
on the Artemis II
mission to the moon.

3
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:06,133
When I first found out
that I was assigned

4
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:09,493
to Artemis II,
my thoughts were disbelief,

5
00:00:09,493 --> 00:00:12,570
an immense sense of honor
and responsibility,

6
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,860
and readiness.

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,940
I'm ready to try to make
everyone proud and to really

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,567
fulfill what this mission
truly means to all humanity.

9
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:21,207
For me, there's never
really been a time

10
00:00:21,207 --> 00:00:22,777
when I didn't want
to be an astronaut.

11
00:00:22,777 --> 00:00:24,297
Going back, as far
as I can remember,

12
00:00:24,297 --> 00:00:26,100
it's what I always dreamed of.

13
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,760
I think the spark was really lit

14
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,440
when I visited
Kennedy Space Center

15
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,660
with my family and came
home with a bunch of posters

16
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:34,200
that then went up
on the walls of my bedroom

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,067
and became the things
that I dreamed of from then on.

18
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:38,837
When I think
about the Artemis II crew,

19
00:00:38,837 --> 00:00:40,287
my first thought is that I am

20
00:00:40,287 --> 00:00:42,067
so privileged
to be a part of it.

21
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:45,117
These other astronauts
have an amazing history,

22
00:00:45,117 --> 00:00:47,257
amazing record,
amazing experience,

23
00:00:47,257 --> 00:00:48,333
and they're great people.

24
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:50,197
I've known them all
for many, many years.

25
00:00:50,197 --> 00:00:51,517
I've had a chance
to work with them

26
00:00:51,517 --> 00:00:53,777
in different capacities,
and I think our skills

27
00:00:53,777 --> 00:00:55,067
really complement each other.

28
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:56,937
They all have
a military background,

29
00:00:56,937 --> 00:00:58,827
and I come from a more raw,

30
00:00:58,827 --> 00:01:01,217
technical engineering
background, and I think

31
00:01:01,217 --> 00:01:03,597
that that complements
one another really well.

32
00:01:03,597 --> 00:01:07,237
I think we'll work together
great, and I hope to be someone

33
00:01:07,237 --> 00:01:09,677
on the crew that really
is that engineering expert,

34
00:01:09,677 --> 00:01:11,057
and I hope
that that can be the way

35
00:01:11,057 --> 00:01:12,267
that I contribute the most.
